  "description": "SIBJOE crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C48 H108 Gd4 K2 O13,C6 H14. From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.493-4.905 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 88.62-171.80°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Gd4K2O(OtBu)12]·C6H14.",
